**Given:**

a : b : c = 1 : 3 : 5

**Calculation:**

Let a = x, b = 3x and c = 5x

⇒ frac{{4a - b + 2c}}{{3( {a + b + c} )}}

Rightarrow frac{{4x - 3x + 2( {5x} )}}{{3( {x + 3x + 5x} )}}

Rightarrow frac{{4x - 3x + 10x}}{{3( {9x} )}}

Rightarrow frac{{11x}}{{27x}}

⇒ 11/27

**∴ The correct answer is 11/27.**
